Refer to the coordinate grid below.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[step=1cm, gray!40, very thin] (-3,-2) grid (3,2);
\draw[thick] (-3,0) -- (3,0);
\draw[thick] (0,-2) -- (0,2);
\node[left, font=\small] at (-3,2) {$40^{\circ}\text{N}$};
\node[left, font=\small] at (-3,1) {$20^{\circ}\text{N}$};
\node[left, font=\small] at (-3,0) {$0^{\circ}$};
\node[left, font=\small] at (-3,-1) {$20^{\circ}\text{S}$};
\node[left, font=\small] at (-3,-2) {$40^{\circ}\text{S}$};
\node[below, font=\small] at (-3,-2) {$60^{\circ}\text{W}$};
\node[below, font=\small] at (-2,-2) {$40^{\circ}\text{W}$};
\node[below, font=\small] at (-1,-2) {$20^{\circ}\text{W}$};
\node[below, font=\small] at (0,-2) {$0^{\circ}$};
\node[below, font=\small] at (1,-2) {$20^{\circ}\text{E}$};
\node[below, font=\small] at (2,-2) {$40^{\circ}\text{E}$};
\node[below, font=\small] at (3,-2) {$60^{\circ}\text{E}$};
\fill (-2,-1) circle (2.5pt) node[above right] {$A$};
\fill (1,2) circle (2.5pt) node[above right] {$B$};
\fill (2,-2) circle (2.5pt) node[above right] {$C$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Which point is located at $(40^{\circ}\text{N}, 20^{\circ}\text{E})$?
